'''Coppermine''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] gains immunity to freeze and increases her health, damage, range and chance to freeze [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Versions 12.5]] and [[Version 15.7 Update|15.7]].

