*A 5★ accessory that may be dropped upon her defeat as an intrusion boss.
*A 6★ dress, also obtained by taking down her hostile boss variant.
*And as a 3★ fancy goods item that can be obtained as a reward for clearing the stage にゃんこ大ラッシュ (Battle Cats Challenge) 12 times.

